---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="VNH Mission | Freedom Through Action"
  description="Learn why VNH focuses on practical products, useful ideas, personal responsibility, and freedom through action."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>
      <h1 class="display">Freedom Through Action</h1>
      <p>Real people. Real purpose. Useful ideas, personal responsibility, and practical solutions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container page-copy">
    <p>VNH exists to create practical products, useful solutions, and original ideas for people who value freedom and responsibility.</p>
    <p>We are building this site as a place to discover new products, explore ideas, and stay up to date as VNH grows. The mission page will expand as the brand story and future programs are finalized.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/#keep-updated">Keep Updated →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
